  "description": "<p>When exporting with binary excluded (the plantpatents dataset restored from plants.tar.gz), the ResourceNotFoundRuntimeException will be logged for an existing resource like <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/audit/c0/c8/af/98/c0c8af98-72a3-4ce0-96f0-aaf9ac2aa161\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/audit/c0/c8/af/98/c0c8af98-72a3-4ce0-96f0-aaf9ac2aa161</a>, while it's the reference resource (&lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/initialize\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/initialize</a>&gt;) that doesn't exist in the repository:<br/>\nINFO 11:05:18.899 (Exporter) Exporting description: <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/audit/c0/c8/af/98/c0c8af98-72a3-4ce0-96f0-aaf9ac2aa161\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/audit/c0/c8/af/98/c0c8af98-72a3-4ce0-96f0-aaf9ac2aa161</a><br/>\norg.fcrepo.importexport.common.ResourceNotFoundRuntimeException: resource not found at <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/audit/c0/c8/af/98/c0c8af98-72a3-4ce0-96f0-aaf9ac2aa161\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/audit/c0/c8/af/98/c0c8af98-72a3-4ce0-96f0-aaf9ac2aa161</a><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.common.TransferProcess.checkValidResponse(TransferProcess.java:192)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.exporter.Exporter.filterBinaryReferences(Exporter.java:377)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.exporter.Exporter.exportDescription(Exporter.java:314)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.exporter.Exporter.export(Exporter.java:246)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.exporter.Exporter.exportMembers(Exporter.java:342)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.exporter.Exporter.exportDescription(Exporter.java:333)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.exporter.Exporter.export(Exporter.java:246)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.exporter.Exporter.exportMembers(Exporter.java:342)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.exporter.Exporter.exportDescription(Exporter.java:333)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.exporter.Exporter.export(Exporter.java:246)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.exporter.Exporter.run(Exporter.java:202)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.ImportExportDriver.run(ImportExportDriver.java:58)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.importexport.ImportExportDriver.main(ImportExportDriver.java:47)</p>",
